.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7LW2G0GeL1S1UIWm7jGlMXInkO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-06-25\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Porky the Disorderly\",\"overview\":\"Porky must escort a very disruptive Daffy off the hospital premises.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pGQJpv4seUvXNZY9CLr5JfgAdei.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-06-25\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Game, Set, Wabbit\",\"overview\":\"Bugs and Viktor compete in a tennis match for the Simbledon Cup.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4BTdIXomQIDpIr4X8Lht4nvtYWU.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-06-25\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Lucky Duck\",\"overview\":\"Down on his luck again, Shameless O'Scanty finds a new lucky charm in the form of Daffy Duck.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uYyIaihsmt4p733EZz6fvwW4HyV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-06-25\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Free Range Foghorn\",\"overview\":\"Daffy pretends to be a chicken for a free stay on Foghorn Leghorn's farm.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/79KFSr06TrQ6ATKTWlAQycAy9DI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-06-25\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Love It or Survivalist It\",\"overview\":\"Survivalist Tad Tucker returns looking to renovate a dilapidated forest home.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iEygmwsHpmH0UzlmqsxHhfWcY72.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-06-25\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"The Porklight\",\"overview\":\"Daffy disrupts a screening of Hamlet at Porky's movie theater.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fqaArHHNuf0rV2FoGan79vCjvvX.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-06-25\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Best Bugs\",\"overview\":\"Spoiled rich kid Paul Perdy forces Bugs to be his best friend for the afternoon.\",\"still\":\"https: